    "text": "A Carnot engine having an efficiency of <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is being used as a refrigerator. If the work done on the refrigerator is <math><mn>10&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> the amount of heat absorbed from the reservoir at a lower temperature is",
